{"id":"214016b8-c136-46e6-8896-7f5b62b959ee","rule_id":"62a70f6f-3c37-43df-a556-f64fa475fba2","name":"【默认】Windows账号配置为永不过期密码","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":217,"revision":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:31.574Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-15T02:32:15.421Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-9m","to":"now","description":"检测账号被设置为密码永不过期。对应需求：修改账号属性。","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","对应需求: 修改账号属性"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.args","process.command_line","process.executable","process.parent.name","process.parent.executable","process.parent.command_line","event.action","event.type","agent.id"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"},{"package":"windows","version":">=3.0.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.code","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"user.id","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"winlog.event_data.AttributeLDAPDisplayName","type":"unknown","ecs":false},{"name":"winlog.event_data.AttributeValue","type":"unknown","ecs":false},{"name":"winlog.event_data.NewUACList","type":"unknown","ecs":false},{"name":"winlog.event_data.ObjectDN","type":"unknown","ecs":false},{"name":"winlog.event_data.OperationType","type":"unknown","ecs":false},{"name":"winlog.event_data.SubjectUserName","type":"keyword","ecs":false}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n需要 Windows/域控安全日志（Winlogbeat 或 Agent Windows 集成）。部分规则依赖活动目录相关事件。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n请结合 Windows 安全事件字段：`user.name`、`source.ip`、`host.name`、`event.code`、`winlog.event_data.*`。\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权。\n2. 无授权则遏制账号并溯源。\n3. 关联同用户的登录失败、组变更、GPO 变更。\n","false_positives":["变更窗口内的合法管理操作","基线学习期的机器学习误报"],"references":["https://www.cert.ssi.gouv.fr/uploads/guide-ad.html#dont_expire","http://web.archive.org/web/20230329171952/https://blog.menasec.net/2019/02/threat-hunting-26-persistent-password.html"],"risk_score":47,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"medium","severity_mapping":[],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"eql","language":"eql","index":["logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","winlogbeat-*"],"query":"any where host.os.type == \"windows\" and\n(\n  (\n    event.code == \"4738\" and winlog.event_data.NewUACList == \"USER_DONT_EXPIRE_PASSWORD\" and not user.id == \"S-1-5-18\"\n  ) or\n  (\n    event.code == \"5136\" and winlog.event_data.AttributeLDAPDisplayName == \"userAccountControl\" and\n    winlog.event_data.AttributeValue in (\"66048\", \"66080\") and winlog.event_data.OperationType == \"%%14674\" and\n    not (\n      winlog.event_data.SubjectUserName : \"*svc*\" or\n      winlog.event_data.ObjectDN : \"*Service*\"\n    )\n  )\n)\n"}
